  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.1.0. First release: UseRabbitMq(...) inside UseOutbox(...), or AddCqrsRabbitMq(...), forwards the notifications it is told to publish to RabbitMQ through the outbox and takes the ones its consumers receive into it; AddCqrsRabbitMq() on the health checks builder reports the connections and consumers.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.1.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes.",
